      CT -> CT : fixed CLI / INITIALIZATION; INTERNAL / INTERNAL_ERROR\nno exception message, stack, observed value or forged property
    end
    note right of CT
      Private error brands select fixed labels
      without reading arbitrary error properties.
      This prevents raw provider output or hostile
      getters from adding private values to the
      failure diagnostic.
    end note
    CT -> CT : main(): JSON line <=4096 UTF-8 bytes; oversize => fixed INTERNAL_ERROR fallback\nno observed values, raw outputs, policy, argv, paths, IDs, hashes, URLs or control characters
    CT --> OP : stderr: existing failure-line VERBATIM, then exactly ONE diagnostic JSON line\nfailure stdout empty; exit 2; prompts and STATE_PATH announcement remain separate
    note over CT, VM
      Host phases locate reporting boundaries,
      not proof that a guest command started or
      stopped. Intent write uncertainty
      establishes neither a safe retry nor the
      presence or absence of a guest reservation.
    end note
  end
end
@enduml
